      "id": "accountant_reads_only_supply_value",
      "kind": "root_cause",
      "text": "suppliedBalance() decodes the four-field 0x811 response but discards the first three fields and returns only supply.value, so borrow.value is ignored at the first accounting boundary.",
      "modality": "asserted",
      "entity_ids": [
        "precompile_reader",
        "borrow_lend_0x811"
      ],
      "evidence_ids": [
        "e_48e20ec1fe72_0044",
        "e_48e20ec1fe72_0045",
        "e_48e20ec1fe72_0046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "read_l1_backing_adds_supply_never_subtracts_borrow",
      "kind": "root_cause",
      "text": "_readL1Backing() only adds supplied values and never reads borrow.value or applies a negative adjustment for liabilities, so totalBackingSigned() is overstated whenever the Vault has a Borrow-Lend liability.",
      "modality": "asserted",
      "entity_ids": [
        "monetrix_accountant",
        "borrow_lend_0x811"
      ],
      "evidence_ids": [
        "e_48e20ec1fe72_0069",
        "e_48e20ec1fe72_0070",
        "e_48e20ec1fe72_0071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "inflated_backing_inflates_surplus",
      "kind": "root_cause",
      "text": "Because totalBackingSigned() is inflated by ignored debt, surplus() and distributableSurplus() are inflated by the same amount, and the settleDailyPnL() gate can approve yield that does not exist under net backing.",
      "modality": "asserted",
      "entity_ids": [
        "monetrix_accountant"
      ],
      "evidence_ids": [
        "e_48e20ec1fe72_0079",
        "e_48e20ec1fe72_0083"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "settle_moves_usdc_to_escrow",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": "settle() moves real USDC out of the Vault into YieldEscrow as yield even though net backing has no surplus.",
      "modality": "asserted",
      "entity_ids": [
        "monetrix_vault",
        "yield_escrow",
        "usdc"
      ],
      "evidence_ids": [
        "e_48e20ec1fe72_0086",
        "e_48e20ec1fe72_0087"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "backing_must_net_borrow_liabilities",
      "kind": "security_intent",
      "text": "When the protocol uses Borrow-Lend supply values as backing, totalBackingSigned() must account for Borrow-Lend liabilities (borrow.value) rather than treating the 0x811 state as supply-only.",
      "modality": "asserted",
      "entity_ids": [
